# v1.21.0 (S24.1) Replace in all notes: the Find bar's All notes scope, All
# opens the review sheet, a note can be unticked, Apply writes the ticked
# matches and the band offers Undo (Forma 1440x1920).
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/lamps.md
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/markdown-tour.md
tap-on Files
tap-on New note
clear-field
type dusk
tap-on OK
type Notes from the bridge at dusk, a lamp by the gate.
tap-on Find
tap-on All notes
expect-mode find
type lamp
tap-on ReplaceField
type lantern
shot v1.21-replace-all-bar
# All opens the review sheet: every note with a match, ticked, with its lines.
tap-on All
shot v1.21-replace-review
# Untick one note: it stays as it is.
tap-on ReviewNote:lamps.md
shot v1.21-replace-review-unticked
# Apply writes the other notes; the band says what was done and offers Undo.
tap-on ReviewApply
shot v1.21-replace-applied
expect-file-contains lamps.md|lamp 1
# Undo puts the notes back.
tap-on ReplaceUndo
shot v1.21-replace-undone
expect-file-contains lamps.md|lamp 1
tap-on FindClose
expect-status saved
